      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The window is frets "
        },
        {
          "text": "0–3",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " — four frets, not five, because the nut cuts it short, exactly as chapter 2 said. Twelve dots live inside those four frets, two on every string, and every fret in the window carries at least one."
        }
      ]
